# The snap's metadata (spec_025_release REL-34): @VERSION@ and @ARCH@ are
# filled in by //apps/electron/packaging:snap_yaml. Classic: the agent
# works on your projects with your own tools, which a confined snap can't
# reach.
name: blitz-desktop
title: Blitz
version: '@VERSION@'
summary: An AI agent for your projects
description: |
  A window onto the Blitz service: workspaces, chats with the agent,
  approvals, changes and workers. Includes the blitz command, blitz-tray
  (the service in the system tray) and blitzd, the service, which it
  installs and starts.
license: Apache-2.0
base: core24
confinement: classic
grade: stable
architectures: [@ARCH@]
apps:
  blitz-desktop:
    command: usr/lib/blitz-desktop/blitz-desktop
  blitz:
    command: usr/lib/blitz-desktop/resources/app/bin/blitz
